  "issue_comments": [
    {
      "body": "Closing this in favor of #21194, which landed on main on 2026-10-29 (60d56ea9) and fixes the same `PPMissingLayer` AttributeError on PP middle stages. I opened this PR as a rebase of #21194 when it looked stalled; it is no longer needed.\r\n\r\nFor the record, we validated the upstream fix on MI355X: on the nightly `lmsysorg/sglang-rocm:v0.5.23-rocm720-mi35x-20261101`, which contains #21194, GLM-5.2-MXFP4 with a TP1 × PP4 prefill (P/D disaggregation) starts and serves without this patch (AgentX run plus GSM8K 0.9666). Thanks @RolaoDenthu for the original fix.",
      "created_at": "2026-11-04T10:48:28Z",
      "html_url": "https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/47184#issuecomment-6628764185",
